	(text "D?: Vishay BPW34 / BPW34S silicon PIN photodiode\n(430-1100 nm, peak ~900 nm, 7.5 mm2).\n\nAnode -> PD_A, Cathode -> PD_K.\nNo bias, no local electronics: the TIA lives on the\nmain Blackbody board (photovoltaic mode).\n\nPlace on the TOP side, centered on the window.\nOptional: PTFE/opal diffuser over it for cosine response."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 26.669999999999998 31.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
