	(text "Mount on the underside of the top shell behind a\nwindow (Ravi); match the module tilt (Aarav).\nKeep the board tiny; 2 mounting holes.\nOld breakout: Power-Generation-Blackbody/\nHardware/IrradianceBreakout (TSL2591, I2C)."
